, {T:home:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-2-5. {T:away:sub} announced a 4-1-4-1 and attacked in a 3-4-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-2-5 with the ball, 4-2-3-1 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 4-1-4-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (26% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 32% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:sub} played wide: 51% of touches in the two outer lanes."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:away:sub} defended higher (back line 28.0 m from goal, against 26.1 m; tournament average: 29.2 m). But the deeper block won: {T:home:sub} chose to wait, and the wait paid off."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 11,3, contre 13,7 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 32 % et 26 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","16 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Victoire du collectif qui court : {T:home:sub} a gagné le match en le jouant dans le camp adverse."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 11.3, against 13.7 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 32% and 26% won back within 5 s.","16 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"A win for the team that ran: {T:home:sub} won the game by playing it in the opponent's half."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:away:sub} et ses petits triangles près du ballon (+0,37) ; de l'autre, {T:home:sub} et ses couloirs bien rangés (−0,98).","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 43 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 56 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Wout Faes, impliqué dans 127 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Andrei Burcă Andonie, impliqué dans 61 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football positionniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"On one side, {T:away:sub} and their little triangles near the ball (+0.37); on the other, {T:home:sub} and their tidy lanes (−0.98).","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 43% short passes (under 15 m), against 56% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Wout Faes, involved in 127 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Andrei Burcă Andonie, involved in 61 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, positional football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Transitions sous contrôle des deux côtés : 3 tir(s) concédé(s) après une perte pour {T:home:sub}, 5 pour {T:away:sub}.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 6,0 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 6,0 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 50 % des cas.","{T:away:Sub} : 5,4 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 4,6 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 25 % des cas."],"impact":"Personne n'a été puni en transition : le match s'est joué en attaque placée."},"en":{"lead":"Transitions under control on both sides: 3 shot(s) conceded after a loss for {T:home:sub}, 5 for {T:away:sub}.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 6.0 players behind the ball at the loss, 6.0 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 50% of cases.","{T:away:sub}: 5.4 players behind the ball at the loss, 4.6 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 25% of cases."],"impact":"Nobody got punished in transition: the match was decided in settled play."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Darius Dumitru Olaru avait un fan-club, et il portait le maillot adverse : 0,92 adversaire par touche de plus